/**
 * Indonesian version of the AI Readiness Check (/id/tools/ai-readiness).
 *
 * The English template (ai-readiness/page/index.html) is the source. The
 * builder (src/lib/ai-readiness-page.ts) makes the Indonesian page from it:
 *
 *  - PAGE: exact English snippets of the template, swapped for Indonesian.
 *    Script strings keep their quotes, so only whole strings match. The build
 *    fails if an English snippet is no longer in the template, so a change to
 *    the English copy can't silently leave English on the Indonesian page.
 *  - ENGINE: the scan engine (ai-readiness/lib/scan.js) keeps answering in
 *    English, so its grading and its tests don't change. The Indonesian page
 *    translates its text when showing it: whole sentences first (exact), then
 *    patterns for sentences built from parts. Anything not covered stays in
 *    English rather than breaking.
 *
 * Wording follows the site's Indonesian copy (src/i18n/id.ts): "Anda",
 * "developer web", "halaman". Terms Indonesian marketers use as they are
 * (crawler, robots.txt, canonical, redirect, sitemap, Heading 1) stay English.
 */

